Subject: [M150] Fix bugs in
 ResourceMultiBufferDataProvider::DidReceiveResponse

Original change's description:
> Fix bugs in ResourceMultiBufferDataProvider::DidReceiveResponse
>
> In ResourceMultiBufferDataProvider::DidReceiveResponse(), check a
> WeakPtr across old_url_data->RedirectTo(destination_url_data).
>
> RedirectTo() synchronously notifies MultiBufferDataSource, which can
> reset reader_ and delete the active ResourceMultiBufferDataProvider when
> the redirect destination already has sufficient cached data and
> cancel_on_defer_ is set.
>
> Fixed: 566824998
> Change-Id: I193b4ffd5427aa0673773a5ec0747adad7fc3953
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8488169
> Commit-Queue: Thomas Guilbert <tguilbert@chromium.org>
> Auto-Submit: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
> Reviewed-by: Thomas Guilbert <tguilbert@chromium.org>
